@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title LAB3 部署图：Windows本地桌面程序
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
node "Windows 10/11 x64" {
  node "泊岸酒店预订系统进程" {
    artifact "StayHotel.exe 或 python run.py" as app
    component "Tk主线程 / 角色页面" as ui
    component "业务服务 / SQLite驱动" as service
    component "5秒维护线程" as job
    app --> ui
    ui --> service
    job --> service
  }
  folder "%LOCALAPPDATA%/StayHotel" {
    database "stay.sqlite3 / WAL / SHM" as db
    artifact "application.log" as log
    folder "backups/*.sqlite3 + 校验清单" as backup
  }
  folder "新文件恢复目标" as restore
  service --> db : 独立连接\nWAL + 外键 + BEGIN IMMEDIATE
  app --> log : 错误日志
  job --> backup : 在线备份，每24小时
  backup --> restore : 关闭程序后CLI恢复\n完整性与业务一致性检查
}
note bottom of app
源码启动需Python 3.11+、Tk与tzdata。
便携目录包含Python/Tk/tzdata，不需另装运行环境。
不部署HTTP服务器、PostgreSQL和移动端。
end note
@enduml
